But ALL of those people identified the ability to operate at a lower and lower cost structure as necessary to offer lower and lower prices / more value as a means of winning. 

It’s core to each player’s strategy.

Off the top of my head, here are 7:

@JeffBezos (Amazon): Free shipping in the most competitive marketplace in human history.  
@mcuban (Cost Plus Drugs): Cheap generic drugs 
Koum (WhatsApp): Free texts and international calls 
@reedhastings (NetFlix): Goodbye cable bill 
Ek (Spotify): All the music for $10/mo 
Page/Brin (Google): Free email, free GPS, free search, etc.   
@CharlesSchwab : $0 commission investing,

